  "body": "Adds the third OpenCode Go account, ordered by Drew 2026-11-08.\n\n- New provider instance opencode-go.developing-today-0 (instanceOf: opencode-go, name \"OpenCode Go (developing-today-0)\"), mirroring the drewrypope/popesdrew instances.\n- Joins the opencode-go-plans composite as a peer at weight 1 (internal split stays equal).\n- No other membership, weight, or route changes.\n\nCredential handling (no key material in this PR):\n- Key stored in the fleet vault as opencode.api-key-developing-today-0 (Bitwarden, project \"developing today\").\n- Server credential created in the OpenCode credential store under integration opencode-go.developing-today-0, label \"OpenCode Go (developing-today-0)\", active.\n- Live-call confirmation through the new account is reported on the fleet side after deploy.\n",
